        <iri>
          <value>https://w3id.org/italia/work-accident/onto/risk_management/BandoISI</value>
          <annotations>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/work-accident/onto/risk_management/BandoISI</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>Bando ISI</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>it</language>
              </object>
            </annotation>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/work-accident/onto/risk_management/BandoISI</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>Il Bando ISI è un finanziamento a fondo perduto promosso dall'INAIL, il quale ha l'obiettivo di incentivare le imprese ad investire nel miglioramento della sicurezza sul lavoro. Il suddetto contributo a fondo perduto viene erogato alle imprese che superano una prima analisi (studio di fattibilità) e successivamente rientrano nella graduatoria con esito positivo, il Click Day Inail. All'ingresso in graduatoria Click Day Inail con esito positivo, segue entro 30 giorni una documentazione per verificare la spesa e la successiva rendicontazione.</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>it</language>
              </object>
            </annotation>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/work-accident/onto/risk_management/BandoISI</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>BANDO ISI funding program</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>en</language>
              </object>
            </annotation>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/work-accident/onto/risk_management/BandoISI</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>BANDO ISI is a funding grant program sponsored by the INAIL institution. Its main puprose is to support companies to reduce risks and improve safety in the workplace. In order to be approved for any of the Bando ISI grants, applicants must successfully complete the three different selection stages. Stage no.1 application review. Stage no.2 a selection process named CLICK DAY that gives direct acces to the official BANDO ISI list. Stage no 3 final decision, INAIL will have 30 days max to check all the documentation provided and make an offer to successfull applicants.</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>en</language>
              </object>
            </annotation>
          </annotations>
        </iri>
