        <iri>
          <value>https://w3id.org/italia/work-accident/onto/risk_management/tipoAssePrevenzione</value>
          <annotations>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/work-accident/onto/risk_management/tipoAssePrevenzione</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>tipo asse prevenzione</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>it</language>
              </object>
            </annotation>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/work-accident/onto/risk_management/tipoAssePrevenzione</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>Indica le 5 tipologie di Asse:
- ASSE 1 - Progetti di investimento e modelli organizzativi e di responsabilità sociale:
   - Investimento (Asse 1.1)
   - Adozione di modelli organizzativi e di responsabilità sociale (Asse 1.2)
- ASSE 2 - Movimentazione manuale dei carichi (MMC):
    Movimentazione Manuale dei Carichi (MMC)
- ASSE 3 - Bonifica da materiali contenenti amianto:
    Bonifica da materiali contenenti amianto
- ASSE 4 - Micro e piccole imprese operanti in specifici settori di attività:
   Imprese operanti in specifici settori di attività
- ASSE 5 - Agricoltura:
   - Progetti del settore della produzione primaria dei prodotti agricoli (Asse 5.1)
   - Progetti presentati da giovani agricoltori (Asse 5.2)</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>it</language>
              </object>
            </annotation>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/work-accident/onto/risk_management/tipoAssePrevenzione</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>funding program Appendix type</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>en</language>
              </object>
            </annotation>
            <annotation>
              <subject>https://w3id.org/italia/work-accident/onto/risk_management/tipoAssePrevenzione</subject>
              <property>http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment</property>
              <object>
                <lexicalForm>The different types of funding available in the BANDO ISI program: - Appendix 1 - Investment, organisational models, and social responsibility risk management plans: - Investment at Appendix 1.1) - Organizational models and social responsibility (at Appendix 1.2) - Appendix 2 - Manual Handling of Loads (MMC): - Appendix 3 - Asbestos remediation programme - Appendix 4 - Microenterprise and small business programme - Appendix 5 - Farming: - risk management plans that focus on agriculture and primary production (at Appendix 5.1) - risk management plans by young farmers operating in the agriculture sector (at Appendix 5.2).</lexicalForm>
                <datatype/>
                <language>en</language>
              </object>
            </annotation>
          </annotations>
        </iri>
        <iri>
          <value>https://w3id.org/italia/work-accident/onto/risk_management/verificaPraticaProgettoPrevenzioneHaStato</value>
          <annotations>
